==Battleground==
*1 [[Sunfish Jones]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*2 [[Berserkory|Berserkories]] spawn after 34.67 seconds<sup>1,040f</sup>, delay 50~53.33 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
One of the easiest strategies, and most reliable ones, for this level is to use [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]] and [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Island Cat]]. While there is a Sunfish Jones, his damage actually turns out to be fairly negligible in the end, meaning that the use of Island + Manic Island, along with [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera]] and [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Jamiera]] is recommended. Using Strong UP [[Cat Combo|Combos]] or Unit Defense UP combos is recommended because it will make all your units more tanky, especially the Islands against the Berserkories if you use Strong combos.

[[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] combined with [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] will make this level a cakewalk. Use lots of research combos like [[Biohazard (Combo)|Bio]][[Bony Bone (Combo)|-Bone]] and spam all of these units endlessly for an easy win! This works even on 3 crown with lvl 30-40 cats. You can also bring [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] for extra damage if you desire.

==Trivia==
*Dungeon of Dreams' Japanese name, Mūru-gai no Akumu (ムール街の悪夢, "Nightmare on Moor Street"), may be a reference to ''[[wikipedia:A Nightmare on Elm Street|A Nightmare on Elm Street]]''.

